le getting invested in the mechanics, controls, and world the game sets up. Very simplistic but well executed. My only gripe is I never made it to the ladder, as this game is pretty difficult. Since the stage is randomly generated, I have no clue if I'm getting close to the end, or if I still have another five minutes of running around hoping I don't have to deal with another centipede with my 3 remaining bullets. \n\nProbably will come back and give it another shot when I have more time, but pretty solid game!", "timestamp_created": 1648080196, "timestamp_updated": 1648080196, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112679317", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059742329", "personaname": "Petah", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198059742329/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 61, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 61, "last_played": 1647989708, "avatar": "0c799ab9e9f6f807552aa82ae08c10d821b7d9c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Spend 60 minutes trying to beat it, beat it and now i'm waiting for more content. Banger soundtrack.", "timestamp_created": 1648013247, "timestamp_updated": 1648013247, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.563492059707641602", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112645927", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004549649", "personaname": "Lazy Fangs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lazy_fangs/", "num_games_