eived_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112264869", "author": {"steamid": "76561198254515024", "personaname": "MP5A5", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DirtDiaz/", "num_games_owned": 134, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 28, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 28, "last_played": 1647390871, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely a masterpiece of an indie game. Even though it took me less than 30 minutes and two attempts to beat the game, I adored everything about it. The hilarious but still amazingly done intro. The satisfying ending with perfect music and animations that kept me through the entire credits section. The spooky aspect with all the dead ends, always having your glock trained at the darkest of corners to look for more ammo. I loved fighting the undead operatives, but wish there was a unique mini-boss for sarge as a brute, like there was for hope as a spider-witch. Maybe even give the rest of the ex-operatives unique 363 forms to keep the player guessing more often. I'd love to see more from these developers wether it be more SCP centered games, or maybe an update to this that allows for co-op support.", "timestamp_created": 1647391553, "timestamp_updated": 1647391553, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47413790225982666", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "112252743", "author": {"steamid": "76561198250136386", "personaname": "Kanio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kaniodon/", "num_games_owned": 532, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 17, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17, "last_played": 1647373076, "avatar": "31337577d86c81d1b78a5fac29fa2bbf6015f53a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I beat it in a very short time, nonetheless it was fun while it lasted and for a small project it was well executed.\nGraphics are not something I consider when judging a game. The sound, however, is important and this was also my main issue during the playthrough, after killing an enemy, their voices were \"following\" me at a very close distance during the entire duration of the game, which was mildly annoying. \nAll in all decent", "timestamp_created": 1647373304, "timestamp_updated": 1647373304, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112226679", "author": {"steamid": "76561198804955672", "personaname": "Gorlock", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198804955672/", "num_games_owned": 392, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 30, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30, "last_played": 1647333304, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "It was 3 AM, i was bored. Great game and Fantastic music.", "timestamp_created": 1647333936, "timestamp_updated": 1647333936, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 29, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.724357306957244873", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "112207052", "author": {"steamid": "76561198274221004", "personaname": "RisingPlague0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198274221004/", "num_games_owned": 125, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 105, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15, "last_played": 1647317727, "avatar": "b30067a496e7b0fa42e7a53b99d9eeba82ae8736"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, has great replayability. Just wish I could see drops more visibly. Like with a green, orange, or yellow outline would help. In my opinion I feel as if there should be more health kits.", "timestamp_created": 1647298110, "timestamp_updated": 1647316121, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1647312761, "developer_response": "Saw your play through of our game on Twitch risingplague0! Thanks for playing and we hope you enjoyed it. Really appreciate you documenting your first impressions and reactions. We can use this to develop fixes for Abhorrent as well as our future games. Thank you :)", "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112182034", "author": {"steamid": "76561198846623189", "personaname": "teo-chan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tfayd/", "num_games_owned": 5, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 27, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 27, "last_played": 1647277292, "avatar": "d5368c34214bc0a7572c77cc4a9bf343684e3c09"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game, miner problems like not much ammo and not many places where to finde it, not very much health(didnt seem to regenerate,neither i found any medkits),the lighting its a bit annoying,cant see that much but its fine (not unplayable)\nIn rest everything is really cool,tense atmosphere, quality scary sounds(if u are easy to scare it will be a just good for you :) ),pretty good A.I.\nbtw,the intro its awesome,i love it :))", "timestamp_created": 1647278349, "timestamp_updated": 1647278463, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112148116", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162576236", "personaname": "MrsSandwich", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kalliestar/", "num_games_owned": 41, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 195, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 179, "last_played": 1647222175, "avatar": "87a61001873c613d6ac191eeb53dd849905c5d55"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sick game, sick music, and cool idea. I havent beat it yet but i will!", "timestamp_created": 1647220744, "timestamp_updated": 1647220744, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.598540186882019043", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1647142140", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "112140676", "author": {"steamid": "76561198213832753", "personaname": "MythCassowary", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198213832753/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 37, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 37, "last_played": 1647209799, "avatar": "db169e7636733e67456eca5e01c4f5cf7b30c7b9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Music ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ Slaps", "timestamp_created": 1647209863, "timestamp_updated": 1647209863, "voted_up":